### Caso válido (ejemplo clásico)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/qr
Content-Type: application/json

{"matrix": [[12, -51, 4], [6, 167, -68], [-4, 24, -41]]}

### Error: filas de distinto tamaño
POST http://localhost:8080/api/qr
Content-Type: application/json

{"matrix": [[1, 2], [3]]}

### Error: valor no numérico
POST http://localhost:8080/api/qr
Content-Type: application/json

{"matrix": [["a"]]}